comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-26T16:19:02.178Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-09-26: all-status searches for extension state inventory, side-effect-free extension, and hosted extension read found closed pm-grst managed state, pm-x6jf public lifecycle SDK, pm-l4c8 runtime describe, and pm-5mua runtime command-path diagnostics. Their shipped runtime probes do not provide the requested static configured-state receipt. GitHub issue: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1316."
